    '|a||The lookup returns u=0.60 — matching the standard gamble result, though the two methods do not always agree so neatly.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Three different procedures, three numbers converging near the same weight — the rest of the calculation now just needs those weights and the time patients spend in each state.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Next chapter: Building the Number':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Now that we have three ways to produce u_t — trade-off, gamble, and descriptive lookup — the final step is turning a whole health profile into one number.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||The QALY is simply the sum, over every period of the patient''s life, of the utility weight times the time spent at that weight — the area under the health-state curve.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Untreated, the patient lives five years at u=0.75, then five more at u=0.50 as the hip deteriorates.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||That profile sums to 3.75 plus 2.5 — 6.25 QALYs, the reference point against which both treatments are judged.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||The hip replacement does not extend life, but it holds quality of life at 0.85 for the full ten years.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Ten years times 0.85 gives 8.5 QALYs — over two full QALYs gained purely from quality, with zero extra survival.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||The drug extends survival to thirteen years, but the side effects hold quality down at 0.60 throughout.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Thirteen times 0.60 gives 7.8 QALYs.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Despite three additional years of life, the drug delivers fewer QALYs than the hip replacement — longevity and quality are literally interchangeable in this arithmetic, and here quality wins.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||This is the entire mechanics of a QALY: elicit a weight for every distinguishable state a person can be in, multiply each by its duration, and add.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||Everything upstream — patient, public, or clinician judgment, captured by time trade-off, standard gamble, or EQ-5D — funnels into that single sum, which is why the same number can look objective while carrying every assumption we just unpacked.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
    '|a||What you can see now is the whole pipeline: a judgment about a state''s worth becomes a weight, the weight becomes an area under a curve, and the area becomes the one figure that decides which of these two treatments looks better on paper.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
      voice: en-US-Studio-Q
